# Settings for tools/split_songs.py when SPEAKER=pheebie (see python tools/split_songs.py -h).
# Otherwise the defaults tuned for sakura_shunka.
# Songs under 2 minutes are dropped (decided after the spot check on 2026-10-19), such as the start of
# each stream and short bits in chat. A song cut in two where a recording's parts meet counts as a whole.
--min-song 120
